    <briefdescription>
<para>Contiguous, physically-backed buffer suitable for DMA and io_uring fixed-buffer registration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Memory is allocated via huge pages (2 MiB) when available; falls back to <computeroutput>mmap(MAP_HUGETLB)</computeroutput> and then to <computeroutput>mmap(MAP_ANONYMOUS)</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Non-copyable; move-only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
